  "label": "User projected onto the vanity behavior depicted in the meme",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the act of preparing one's nails, as implied by the text 'get your nails ready, you never know when you have to show them off'. This suggests the user is being addressed as if they are the one who needs to be ready to show off their nails, thereby identifying the user with the vanity behavior being portrayed. The projection is onto the textual material and the visual material of the nail grooming scene, which together form the 'nail_vanity_scene'.",
